{
  "id": 7886,
  "title": "通信量分析",
  "meta_title": "分析 FSDP 中的通信量",
  "meta_description": "计算并优化分片设置中参数同步所需的通信开销",
  "content": "<p>通过分片扩展内存容量带来一个必然的权衡：网络使用率增加。ZeRO 阶段通过在设备间划分状态有效解决了内存瓶颈，但它们从根本上改变了训练循环的通信模式。在标准分布式数据并行 (DDP) 设置中，通信仅限于反向传播 (backpropagation)阶段，梯度在此同步。相反，完全分片数据并行 (FSDP) 在前向传播和反向传播阶段都需要主动通信，以按需实现参数 (parameter)。</p>\n<p>明确数据传输量对于设计集群拓扑结构以及调试性能退步很重要。如果网络互联无法维持所需的吞吐量 (throughput)，GPU 计算单元将停滞，闲置等待参数分片到达。</p>\n<h3>分片中的通信原语</h3>\n<p>为了分析带宽需求，我们必须首先识别出 ZeRO 使用的特定集合通信原语。与主要依赖 <code>AllReduce</code> 的 DDP 不同，FSDP 使用 <code>AllGather</code> 和 <code>ReduceScatter</code>。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>AllGather</strong>：用于从分片中重建完整的模型参数 (parameter)。在特定层执行其前向或反向计算之前，每个 GPU 必须获取通信组中所有其他 GPU 上托管的参数分片。</li>\n<li><strong>ReduceScatter</strong>：用于同步和分片梯度。反向传播 (backpropagation)为层计算梯度后，这些梯度在所有工作器之间平均，并立即划分，以便每个 GPU 只存储与其参数分片对应的梯度分片。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>数学成本模型</h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span></span></span></span> 表示模型参数的总数。我们假设进行混合精度训练，其中参数和梯度以 16 位格式（FP16 或 BF16）存储，意味着每个元素占用 2 字节。</p>\n<p>在一个有 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span> 个 GPU 的集群中，一个标准的 DDP 实现每步对梯度执行一次 <code>AllReduce</code> 操作。使用基于环或基于树的算法，<code>AllReduce</code> 的通信量是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2Ψ</span></span></span></span>。这实际上意味着每个参数元素每训练步遍历网络两次（一次用于归约，一次用于广播），与 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span> 无关（对于大的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{DDP} \\approx 2\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2Ψ</span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>FSDP 改变了这个等式。由于参数被分片，它们在本地不可用。训练步骤遵循以下顺序：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>前向传播</strong>：触发 <code>AllGather</code> 来收集参数。每个秩下载 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N-1}{N} \\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span></span></span></span> 数据。</li>\n<li><strong>反向传播（预计算）</strong>：参数，通常在前向传播后为节省内存而被丢弃，必须再次 <code>AllGather</code> 以计算相对于输入的梯度。</li>\n<li><strong>反向传播（后计算）</strong>：计算出的梯度使用 <code>ReduceScatter</code> 进行同步和分片。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>FSDP（特别是 ZeRO-3）每步的总数据传输量是这三项操作的总和。对于大的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span>，<code>AllGather</code> 和 <code>ReduceScatter</code> 的成本都接近 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mtext>前向_收集</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mtext>反向_收集</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi><mtext>梯度_分散</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{FSDP} \\approx \\Psi_{\\text{前向\\_收集}} + \\Psi_{\\text{反向\\_收集}} + \\Psi_{\\text{梯度\\_分散}} = 3\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">前向</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">_</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">收集</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">反向</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">_</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">收集</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">梯度</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">_</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">分散</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3Ψ</span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>这项分析显示出一个重要的架构含义：<strong>FSDP 需要大约 1.5 倍于 DDP 的通信带宽</strong> (<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3Ψ</span></span></span></span> vs <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2Ψ</span></span></span></span>)。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"graphviz-container graphviz-enlargeable\" \n              data-graph-id=\"graph-1i5bhqi\" \n              data-graph-definition='digraph G {\n    rankdir=TB;\n    bgcolor=\"transparent\";\n    node [style=filled, shape=box, fontname=\"Arial\", fontsize=10, color=\"#dee2e6\"];\n    edge [fontname=\"Arial\", fontsize=9, color=\"#868e96\"];\n\n    subgraph cluster_0 {\n        label=\"前向传播\";\n        style=dashed;\n        color=\"#adb5bd\";\n        \n        StartFwd [label=\"分片参数（本地存储）\", fillcolor=\"#eebefa\"];\n        AllGather1 [label=\"AllGather 操作\", shape=diamond, fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\"];\n        FullParams1 [label=\"完整层参数（临时）\", fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"];\n        ComputeFwd [label=\"计算输出\", fillcolor=\"#e9ecef\"];\n        \n        StartFwd -> AllGather1 [label=\"网络\"];\n        AllGather1 -> FullParams1;\n        FullParams1 -> ComputeFwd;\n    }\n\n    subgraph cluster_1 {\n        label=\"反向传播\";\n        style=dashed;\n        color=\"#adb5bd\";\n        \n        GradIn [label=\"来自下一层的梯度\", fillcolor=\"#ffc9c9\"];\n        AllGather2 [label=\"AllGather 操作\", shape=diamond, fillcolor=\"#a5d8ff\"];\n        FullParams2 [label=\"完整层参数（临时）\", fillcolor=\"#d0bfff\"];\n        ComputeGrad [label=\"计算梯度\", fillcolor=\"#e9ecef\"];\n        ReduceScatter [label=\"ReduceScatter 操作\", shape=diamond, fillcolor=\"#ffc9c9\"];\n        ShardedGrad [label=\"分片梯度（本地存储）\", fillcolor=\"#fcc2d7\"];\n\n        GradIn -> ComputeGrad;\n        AllGather2 -> FullParams2;\n        FullParams2 -> ComputeGrad;\n        ComputeGrad -> ReduceScatter [label=\"完整梯度\"];\n        ReduceScatter -> ShardedGrad [label=\"网络\"];\n    }\n}' \n              data-original-width=\"1200px\"\n              style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 200px;\"\n              title=\"Click to enlarge\"\n              aria-label=\"Graphviz diagram - click to enlarge\"\n              tabindex=\"0\"\n              role=\"button\"\n              onclick=\"window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n              onkeydown=\"if(event.key==='Enter') window.enlargeGraphviz(this)\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"graph-1i5bhqi\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>数据流显示了 FSDP 中完整参数的瞬时特性。与参数持续存在的 DDP 不同，FSDP 需要网络传输来为前向和反向传播实现权重 (weight)，随后对梯度进行分散操作。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>带宽饱和和节点扩展</h3>\n<p>公式 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{FSDP} \\approx 3\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3Ψ</span></span></span></span> 是一个假设 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span> 值很大的近似值。基于环的集合操作的精确通信成本，<code>AllReduce</code> 为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\frac{N-1}{N} \\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span></span></span></span>，<code>AllGather/ReduceScatter</code> 为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N-1}{N} \\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Ψ</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>随着集群大小 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span> 的增加，项 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N-1}{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 迅速接近 1。这表明增加更多 GPU 并不能减少每个 GPU 的通信量。相反，它使每个 GPU 的吞吐量 (throughput)要求保持不变，同时增加了集群的总聚合带宽。</p>\n<p>这种恒定的每个设备带宽压力使 FSDP 对“落后者”或慢节点很敏感。如果集群中的单个链路协商到较低的速度（例如，从 InfiniBand HDR 回退到 EDR，或 TCP 重传问题），整个组的 <code>AllGather</code> 集合操作将以最慢链路的速度运行。</p>\n<p>下图比较了每训练步所需的理论最小数据传输量，针对不同的模型大小。请注意随着模型大小增长，DDP 和 FSDP 之间的差异。</p>\n\n            <div\n              class=\"plotly-container\" \n              data-plot-id=\"plot-1hgtlp7\" \n              data-plot-definition='{\n  \"layout\": {\n    \"title\": \"每步通信量：DDP vs FSDP (ZeRO-3)\",\n    \"xaxis\": { \"title\": \"模型大小（十亿参数）\", \"showgrid\": true, \"gridcolor\": \"#e9ecef\" },\n    \"yaxis\": { \"title\": \"每个 GPU 传输的数据量 (GB)\", \"showgrid\": true, \"gridcolor\": \"#e9ecef\" },\n    \"plot_bgcolor\": \"white\",\n    \"paper_bgcolor\": \"white\",\n    \"font\": { \"family\": \"Arial, sans-serif\", \"color\": \"#495057\" },\n    \"legend\": { \"x\": 0.05, \"y\": 1 }\n  },\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"scatter\",\n      \"mode\": \"lines+markers\",\n      \"name\": \"DDP (2\\u03a8)\",\n      \"x\": [1, 7, 13, 30, 70],\n      \"y\": [4, 28, 52, 120, 280],\n      \"line\": { \"color\": \"#228be6\", \"width\": 3 },\n      \"marker\": { \"size\": 8 }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"scatter\",\n      \"mode\": \"lines+markers\",\n      \"name\": \"FSDP (3\\u03a8)\",\n      \"x\": [1, 7, 13, 30, 70],\n      \"y\": [6, 42, 78, 180, 420],\n      \"line\": { \"color\": \"#fa5252\", \"width\": 3, \"dash\": \"dash\" },\n      \"marker\": { \"size\": 8 }\n    }\n  ]\n}' \n              style=\"max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; min-height: 300px;\"\n            >\n              <div id=\"plot-1hgtlp7\" style=\"width: 100%; min-height: 300px;\"></div>\n            </div>\n          \n<blockquote>\n<p>16 位混合精度训练的网络流量比较。随着模型规模扩展到 700 亿参数 (parameter)，FSDP 需要在网络互联中传输 420GB 的数据，对于每个优化器步骤，这仅用于参数和梯度同步。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>粒度和延迟隐藏</h3>\n<p>虽然带宽 (GB/s) 决定了大型张量的传输时间，但延迟（微秒）决定了小型张量的性能。FSDP 的一个朴素实现可能会尝试单独分片每个线性层。对于包含独立的键、查询和值投影层的 Transformer 块，这将触发三个单独的小 <code>AllGather</code> 操作。</p>\n<p>启动集合通信核的开销通常超过小型负载的传输时间。为了减轻这种情况，PyTorch FSDP 将参数 (parameter)聚合成“扁平参数”。这种机制将模块内（如 Transformer 解码器层）的多个小型张量扁平化为一个连续的内存块。</p>\n<p>这种聚合有两个作用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>向量 (vector)化</strong>：它允许 <code>AllGather</code> 对更大的数据块进行操作，更好地使用互联带宽。</li>\n<li><strong>通信-计算重叠</strong>：通过定义一个分片“单元”（通常是一个 Transformer 块），FSDP 可以在 GPU 忙于计算块 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span> 的同时预取块 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 的参数。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>如果 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3Ψ</span></span></span></span> 的通信时间超过了前向/反向传播 (backpropagation)的计算时间，训练就会受到通信限制。这个比率是调整大型集群时的主要效率指标。高效扩展需要网络互联提供足够的带宽，以使：</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>通信</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>计算</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{通信}} \\leq T_{\\text{计算}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">通信</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">计算</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>当满足此条件时，并且重叠策略配置正确，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\Psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3Ψ</span></span></span></span> 数据传输的成本可以被有效隐藏在矩阵乘法的算术强度后面。</p>",
